      <MissionDesc>PGF'S GOAL IS TO REHABILITATE MARGINALIZED AND AT-RISK COMMUNITIES BY FOSTERING THEIR ECONOMIC, SOCIAL, AND POLITICAL DEVELOPMENT, WITH A PARTICULAR FOCUS ON SUPPORTING THE RECENTLY INCARCERATED</MissionDesc>
      <SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>false</SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>
